  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-08-10T16:11:36.425Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRCScaleConstraints will not scale down avatar hands for the local player, but will do so correctly for remote players.\n\nTo recreate;  Put a scale constraint on an avatar's wrist bones.  \n\nAssign it to an empty transform put on the avatar (Does not matter if within armature or outside it)\n\nScale the transform down via toggled synced animation.  Hand will remain same size for avatar-wearer, but will scale down correctly for remote users.",
